  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&#x201C;We Shape&#x201D; - Conference on Strategies for Sustainable Gender Equality in Creative Industries</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The &amp;quot;We Shape&amp;quot; international conference is committed to advancing sustainable gender equality in Creative and Cultural Industries (CCI). Over two days, it will bring together 100+ professionals for collaborative discussions and innovative approaches. The goal is to reshape norms, amplify underrepresented voices, and foster positive change, particularly in the Western Balkans region. The conference&amp;#39;s &amp;quot;We Shape&amp;quot; theme inspires collective action, empowering individuals to actively contribute to reshaping the narrative of gender in the creative realm.</narrative>
  </description>
